    <string name="connect_usb_absent">Connect the cable and open Mac Second Monitor on the Mac.</string>
    <string name="connect_usb_help">How to set up USB</string>
    <string name="connect_usb_help_body">1. On this device, open Settings → About and tap “Build number” seven times to enable Developer options.\n2. In Settings → System → Developer options, turn on “USB debugging” (on HUAWEI devices also “Allow ADB debugging in charge only mode”).\n3. Connect the cable to the Mac and allow USB debugging when asked.\n4. Open Mac Second Monitor on the Mac. This app opens and connects by itself.</string>
